{"id":"gehalt","lemma":"Gehalt","pos":"noun","rank":3016,"glosses":["salary","pension, annuity"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈhalt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a2/De-Gehalt.ogg/De-Gehalt.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gehalts","plural":"Gehälter"},"examples":[{"text":"Er bekommt ein gutes Gehalt.","en":"He receives a high salary.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin mit meinem Gehalt zufrieden.","en":"I'm content with my salary.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"satisfied"}]},{"text":"Ich komme mit einem kleinen Gehalt aus.","en":"I manage to get along on a small salary.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"small, little, wee","l":"klein"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Er verdient das Doppelte meines Gehalts.","en":"He earns twice my salary.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"deserved"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"double","l":"doppelt"},{"g":"mine","l":"meiner"},null]},{"text":"Die Gehälter fangen endlich wieder an, zu steigen.","en":"Wages are finally starting to rise again.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to catch"},{"g":"eventually"},{"g":"again"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to ascend"}]}]}